<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">她说这世界早已支离破碎</text><text for="L2">这念头总在她心头萦绕</text><text for="L3">每当新闻里枪声响起 她总忍不住落泪</text><text for="L4">每一次都是如此</text><text for="L5">可我无法修复这残局 我无法让这一切停息</text><text for="L6">所以我说 “关掉手机吧 看着我的双眼</text><text for="L7">我们能不能去过真正的生活 现实的生活？”</text><text for="L8">嘿 “关掉手机吧 看着我的双眼</text><text for="L9">我们能不能去过真正的生活 现实的生活？”</text><text for="L10">当双子塔轰然倒塌 她跪地祈祷</text><text for="L11">向着一个她素未谋面的神灵</text><text for="L12">她苦苦哀求神明阻止这场浩劫</text><text for="L13">正如波士顿的炸弹接连引爆 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(呜)</span></text><text for="L14">她说 “我怎么可能去信仰一个</text><text for="L15">只会袖手旁观的神明？”</text><text for="L16">我无言以对 因为我想我也已信仰崩塌</text><text for="L17">可我仍心存感激 盼着一切好转的那一天到来</text><text for="L18">可我无法挽回这一切 也无法让灾难止步</text><text for="L19">所以我说 “关掉手机吧 凝视我的双眼</text><text for="L20">我们能不能去过真正的生活 真实的生活？”</text><text for="L21">嘿 “关掉手机吧 凝视我的双眼</text><text for="L22">我们能不能去过真正的生活 真实的生活？”</text><text for="L23">但愿我能给你答案</text><text for="L24">给你些许能够紧握的依靠</text><text for="L25">而对我而言唯一真实的</text><text for="L26">唯有你</text><text for="L27">“关掉手机吧 唯有看着我的双眼</text><text for="L28">我们能不能去过真正的生活 真实的生活？”</text><text for="L29">嘿 “关掉手机吧 唯有看着我的双眼</text><text for="L30">我们能不能去过真正的生活 真实的生活？”</text><text for="L31">噢 嘿 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(现实生活 嘿)</span></text><text for="L32">真正的生活 真实的生活</text><text for="L33">噢 嘿</text><text for="L34">真正的人生 现实的生活</text><text for="L35">噢 嘿</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Real Life"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Imagine Dragons"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Origins (Deluxe Edition)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71816170"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1437949222"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:29.280" end="3:56.310"><p begin="0:29.280" end="0:32.790" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.280" end="0:29.460">She</span> <span begin="0:29.460" end="0:29.880">says</span> <span begin="0:29.880" end="0:30.120">that</span> <span begin="0:30.120" end="0:30.270">the</span> <span begin="0:30.270" end="0:30.660">world</span> <span begin="0:30.660" end="0:30.810">is</span> <span begin="0:30.810" end="0:30.870">a</span> <span begin="0:30.870" end="0:31.350">broken</span> <span begin="0:31.350" end="0:32.790">mess</span></p><p begin="0:33.000" end="0:35.663" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.000" end="0:33.360">It's</span> <span begin="0:33.360" end="0:33.900">always</span> <span begin="0:33.900" end="0:34.140">on</span> <span begin="0:34.140" end="0:34.230">her</span> <span begin="0:34.230" end="0:35.663">mind</span></p><p begin="0:39.060" end="0:42.600" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.060" end="0:39.300">She</span> <span begin="0:39.300" end="0:39.750">cries</span> <span begin="0:39.750" end="0:39.900">at</span> <span begin="0:39.900" end="0:40.050">the</span> <span begin="0:40.050" end="0:40.470">news</span> <span begin="0:40.470" end="0:40.590">when</span> <span begin="0:40.590" end="0:40.650">the</span> <span begin="0:40.650" end="0:41.070">shots</span> <span begin="0:41.070" end="0:41.400">ring</span> <span begin="0:41.400" end="0:42.600">out</span></p><p begin="0:43.200" end="0:45.920" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.200" end="0:43.560">Every</span> <span begin="0:43.560" end="0:44.130">single</span> <span begin="0:44.130" end="0:45.920">time</span></p><p begin="0:48.960" end="0:53.220" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.960" end="0:49.530">No,</span> <span begin="0:49.530" end="0:49.680">I</span> <span begin="0:49.680" end="0:50.370">cannot</span> <span begin="0:50.370" end="0:50.790">fix</span> <span begin="0:50.790" end="0:50.970">it,</span> <span begin="0:50.970" end="0:51.330">no,</span> <span begin="0:51.330" end="0:51.510">I</span> <span begin="0:51.510" end="0:52.170">cannot</span> <span begin="0:52.170" end="0:52.560">make</span> <span begin="0:52.560" end="0:52.680">it</span> <span begin="0:52.680" end="0:53.220">stop</span></p><p begin="0:53.220" end="0:59.550" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.220" end="0:53.430">So</span> <span begin="0:53.430" end="0:53.640">I</span> <span begin="0:53.640" end="0:54.660">said,"</span><span begin="0:54.720" end="0:55.140">Turn</span> <span begin="0:55.140" end="0:55.230">your</span> <span begin="0:55.230" end="0:55.650">phone</span> <span begin="0:55.650" end="0:56.669">off,</span> <span begin="0:57.210" end="0:57.690">only</span> <span begin="0:57.690" end="0:58.020">look</span> <span begin="0:58.020" end="0:58.410">me</span> <span begin="0:58.410" end="0:58.620">in</span> <span begin="0:58.620" end="0:58.950">my</span> <span begin="0:58.950" end="0:59.550">eyes</span></p><p begin="0:59.580" end="1:03.630" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.580" end="1:00.030">Can</span> <span begin="1:00.030" end="1:00.120">we</span> <span begin="1:00.120" end="1:00.450">live</span> <span begin="1:00.450" end="1:01.470">that</span> <span begin="1:01.470" end="1:01.950">real</span> <span begin="1:01.950" end="1:02.670">life,</span> <span begin="1:02.700" end="1:03.180">real</span> <span begin="1:03.180" end="1:03.630">life?"</span></p><p begin="1:03.690" end="1:09.390" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.690" end="1:03.990">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:03.990" end="1:04.500">hey,"</span><span begin="1:04.560" end="1:04.920">Turn</span> <span begin="1:04.920" end="1:05.010">your</span> <span begin="1:05.010" end="1:05.430">phone</span> <span begin="1:05.430" end="1:06.570">off,</span> <span begin="1:06.990" end="1:07.440">only</span> <span begin="1:07.440" end="1:07.800">look</span> <span begin="1:07.800" end="1:08.190">me</span> <span begin="1:08.190" end="1:08.400">in</span> <span begin="1:08.400" end="1:08.850">my</span> <span begin="1:08.850" end="1:09.390">eyes</span></p><p begin="1:09.420" end="1:13.620" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.420" end="1:09.840">Can</span> <span begin="1:09.840" end="1:09.900">we</span> <span begin="1:09.900" end="1:10.260">live</span> <span begin="1:10.260" end="1:10.848">that</span> <span begin="1:11.280" end="1:11.790">real</span> <span begin="1:11.790" end="1:12.480">life,</span> <span begin="1:12.510" end="1:12.990">real</span> <span begin="1:12.990" end="1:13.620">life?"</span></p><p begin="1:13.650" end="1:16.830" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.650" end="1:14.010">Prays</span> <span begin="1:14.010" end="1:14.250">on</span> <span begin="1:14.250" end="1:14.340">her</span> <span begin="1:14.340" end="1:14.790">knees</span> <span begin="1:14.790" end="1:14.880">when</span> <span begin="1:14.880" end="1:14.970">the</span> <span begin="1:14.970" end="1:15.480">towers</span> <span begin="1:15.480" end="1:16.830">fall</span></p><p begin="1:17.070" end="1:19.890" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.070" end="1:17.340">To</span> <span begin="1:17.340" end="1:17.430">a</span> <span begin="1:17.430" end="1:17.760">God</span> <span begin="1:17.760" end="1:17.910">she</span> <span begin="1:17.910" end="1:18.240">does</span> <span begin="1:18.240" end="1:18.480">not</span> <span begin="1:18.480" end="1:19.890">know</span></p><p begin="1:23.130" end="1:26.580" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.130" end="1:23.490">She's</span> <span begin="1:23.490" end="1:24.090">begging</span> <span begin="1:24.090" end="1:24.540">him</span> <span be