0" end="1:45.420">I</span> <span begin="1:45.420" end="1:45.840">think</span> <span begin="1:45.840" end="1:45.990">I</span> <span begin="1:45.990" end="1:46.380">lost</span> <span begin="1:46.380" end="1:46.590">my</span> <span begin="1:46.590" end="1:47.550">faith</span></p><p begin="1:47.580" end="1:52.650" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.580" end="1:47.790">But</span> <span begin="1:47.790" end="1:47.880">I</span> <span begin="1:47.880" end="1:48.270">thank</span> <span begin="1:48.270" end="1:48.420">you</span> <span begin="1:48.420" end="1:49.020">for</span> <span begin="1:49.020" end="1:49.110">the</span> <span begin="1:49.110" end="1:49.694">day</span> <span begin="1:50.160" end="1:50.550">when</span> <span begin="1:50.550" end="1:51.450">everything</span> <span begin="1:51.450" end="1:51.540">will</span> <span begin="1:51.540" end="1:51.960">be</span> <span begin="1:51.960" end="1:52.650">okay</span></p><p begin="1:52.650" end="1:56.880" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.650" end="1:52.830">But</span> <span begin="1:52.830" end="1:53.250">no,</span> <span begin="1:53.250" end="1:53.370">I</span> <span begin="1:53.370" end="1:54.030">cannot</span> <span begin="1:54.030" end="1:54.450">fix</span> <span begin="1:54.450" end="1:54.750">it,</span> <span begin="1:54.750" end="1:55.020">and</span> <span begin="1:55.020" end="1:55.200">I</span> <span begin="1:55.200" end="1:55.830">cannot</span> <span begin="1:55.830" end="1:56.250">make</span> <span begin="1:56.250" end="1:56.400">it</span> <span begin="1:56.400" end="1:56.880">stop</span></p><p begin="1:56.880" end="2:03.240" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.880" end="1:57.120">So</span> <span begin="1:57.120" end="1:57.330">I</span> <span begin="1:57.330" end="1:57.930">said,"</span><span begin="1:58.380" end="1:58.800">Turn</span> <span begin="1:58.800" end="1:58.890">your</span> <span begin="1:58.890" end="1:59.340">phone</span> <span begin="1:59.340" end="2:0